  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sub-National Governance Programme II (SNG II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SNG-II is an FCDO funded four-year technical assistance programme supporting provincial and district governments in Punjab and Khyber-Pakhtunkhwa to improve planning, financial management and governance, and build sustainable capacities for improved service delivery. At impact level, the programme aims to strengthen democracy, prioritise economic growth and reduce poverty in Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
